      "equivalent": "a stage that reaches this point passed the recompute check, which made its residual payload equal to A x - b for the solution, and that is zero",
      "outcome": "demonstrably_equivalent"
    },
    {
      "name": "residual predicate never held",
      "old": "    checks.record(\"final_residual_zero\", zero, &Datum::Null);",
      "new": "    checks.record(\"final_residual_zero\", false, &Datum::Null);",
      "outcome": "killed"
    },
    {
      "name": "some residual entry zero is enough",
      "old": "    let zero = residual.is_some_and(|entries| entries.iter().all(Zero::is_zero));",
      "new": "    let zero = residual.is_some_and(|entries| entries.iter().any(Zero::is_zero));",
      "equivalent": "the residual payload has one entry for each equation, at least one, and the recompute check made every entry zero, so any and all agree",
      "outcome": "demonstrably_equivalent"
    },
    {
      "name": "missing residual is zero",
      "old": "    let zero = residual.is_some_and(|entries| entries.iter().all(Zero::is_zero));",
      "new": "    let zero = residual.is_none_or(|entries| entries.iter().all(Zero::is_zero));",
      "equivalent": "the residual payload read as rationals exists whenever the recompute check passed, so the missing case cannot arise",
      "outcome": "demonstrably_equivalent"
    },
    {
      "name": "certified under another code",
